      "id": "claim_8b467fe337b24da2881bfd58328492a6",
      "statement": "RunnableBranch routes execution to one of multiple branches based on sequential condition evaluation. The first condition returning True selects its branch; if none match, the default branch executes. Conditions can be sync, async, or awaitable callables returning bool.",
